1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,025
Your reranker has a ceiling, and it was set
before the reranker ever runs.

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:12,030
A reranker only reorders the candidates the
first stage gives it, usually the top

3
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:12,325
100.

4
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:20,750
If the right passage is in the top 100 only 70%
of the time, recall at 100 is 0.70.

5
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,575
No reranker can do better than that.

6
00:00:24,183 --> 00:00:29,577
In that case, the fix belongs upstream, in the
first-stage retriever, not in the

7
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:30,183
reranker.

8
00:00:31,183 --> 00:00:36,713
So measure first-stage recall before you add a
reranker, and report it alongside

9
00:00:36,713 --> 00:00:38,233
every reranker result.

10
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:42,850
The full guide to adding a
reranker is on vidyal.ai.
